
# SQL Server

SQL Server was used for data storage, transformation and analysis.

Activities Performed:
 - Created database
 - Created a schema
 - Loaded raw csv data
 - created raw tables
 - Created SQL views from raw tables
 - Used aggregations 
 - Used window functions
 - created analytical queries
 - stored analytical queries within stored procedures


The prepared views were later imported into Power BI

